at 60 second intervals over the day February 21, 2009. The following will suffice:
 	mbotps \-\-tide-position=125/36 \-\-start-time=2009/02/21/00/00/00 \\
 			\-\-end-time=2009/02/21/23/59/59 \-\-verbose
